TEST-ONLY KEYS. NOT FOR RELEASES. The private keys here are public.

A test key chain for ndsign and nd_package (P2-01,
docs/architecture/packaging.md §4): root -> channel "test" -> release
"test-release", both certificates seq 1, expiring 2100-01-01
(4102444800), scope "*", usage manifest and trust-cache. other-root is an
unrelated key for "wrong key" tests. A kernel trusts this root only when a
test boots it with nd_pkg_root=<root.pub> (docs/kernel/amfi-provider.md
§4.5); no image NeoDarwin ships names it.

Regenerated with //tools/ndsign: ndsign keygen NAME, then ndsign certify
(see tools/ndsign/Sources/ndsign/main.swift).
